cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "chemistry-framework: configuration-driven, evidence-guided molecular property prediction"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the manuscript "Evidence-Guided Molecular Property Modelling
  with a Configuration-Driven Modular Framework": training-partition feature
  evidence scorecard, evidence-guided descriptor recommender, modular
  prior/residual predictor, benchmark runners, archived per-split results, and
  the statistics scripts that regenerate every paired comparison reported in the
  manuscript.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/soratori1025/Framework-Chemistry"
url: "https://github.com/soratori1025/Framework-Chemistry"
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - molecular property prediction
  - D-MPNN
  - feature selection
  - reproducible benchmark
